#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:3
msgid ""
"This record continues the [earlier SoC baseline](soc-refinement-"
"verification.md). The {download}`55-item ledger <../design/soc-refinement-"
"execution.csv>` retains its original exit conditions. Implemented software, "
"executed software evidence and physical acceptance are separate states. "
"Hardware is not connected; every physical result remains `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"本记录延续[较早 SoC 基线](soc-refinement-verification.md)。{download}`55 项台账 "
"<../design/soc-refinement-execution.csv>` "
"保留原始退出条件。已实现软件、实际软件证据和物理验收为不同状态。硬件未连接，全部物理结果保持 `not_executed`。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:9
msgid ""
"The qualified software source is commit "
"`98270512ea2ff7eefe8ff79720018e582be3a949`, tree "
"`8d3e69d3179d7b0d2382c5fd074c970dfc9348d9`. All formal runs use the clean "
"canonical checkout and verify unchanged source inputs. Later documentation "
"commits record this source; they do not claim a new software execution."
msgstr ""
"已资格化软件源码为 commit `98270512ea2ff7eefe8ff79720018e582be3a949`，tree "
"`8d3e69d3179d7b0d2382c5fd074c970dfc9348d9`。所有正式执行使用干净 canonical "
"checkout，并核对源码输入未变。后续文档提交记录该源码，不声称重新执行软件。"

