#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:29
msgid ""
"These scopes overlap and must not be added into a unique-test total. The "
"source SDK tests intentionally create a nonpublishable development fixture "
"to exercise failure boundaries. The separately packaged clean SDK requires "
"its own actual verification before candidate sealing."
msgstr ""
"这些范围存在重叠，不得相加为独立测试总数。Source SDK 测试有意创建不可发布开发夹具，以执行失败边界。独立打包的干净 SDK "
"在候选封存前需另行实际校验。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:34
msgid ""
"[GitHub CI run 38256744920](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/actions/runs/38256744920) completed successfully for this exact "
"source: 29 successful jobs and one normal branch-conditioned documentation "
"deployment skip. Debug, Release, ASan/UBSan and TSan each executed all 199 "
"CTest entries and 3252 Google cases. The artifact catalog is an API "
"observation; it is not a claim that every remote archive was downloaded and "
"independently checked."
msgstr ""
"[GitHub CI run 38256744920](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/actions/runs/38256744920) 针对精确源码成功完成：29 个成功 "
"job，一次普通分支条件文档部署跳过。Debug、Release、ASan／UBSan、TSan 分别执行全部 199 个 CTest 和 3252 个"
" Google 用例。产物目录是 API 观察，不声称已下载并独立校验所有远程归档。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:41
msgid ""
"Eight unsigned software candidates passed sealing and the platform's "
"complete packed verification. Each has all six required qualification scopes"
" bound to its actual run-a ELF and configuration. Sixteen independent builds"
" used 32 network-disabled container commands; all eight ELF/BIN pairs are "
"byte-identical. Both maps and original raw logs are retained. The "
"{download}`source-bound result index <soc-extensions-results.json>` records "
"the precise candidate identities, independent review and durable archive "
"references."
msgstr ""
"八个无签名软件候选通过封存及平台完整打包校验；每个候选的六类必需资格均绑定实际 run-a ELF 和配置。十六次独立构建使用 32 "
"条断网容器命令，八组 ELF／BIN 对均逐字节一致。两份 map 和原始日志全部保留。{download}`源码绑定结果索引 <soc-"
"extensions-results.json>` 记录精确候选身份、独立审查和持久归档引用。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:49
msgid ""
"The final closure check found 102 report references to cleaned SDK fixture "
"paths. Their 1,871,287 bytes were restored only from already retained, hash-"
"identical artifacts. Original reports and qualifications were not rewritten;"
" the first failed closure check remains recorded. All eight complete "
"closures subsequently passed the original validator. The archived Native "
"executables and test sources also remain available for audit. Native binary "
"hashes are explicitly bound at archive time, rather than presented as "
"invented execution-time signatures."
msgstr ""
"最终闭包检查发现 102 个报告引用指向已清理 SDK 夹具路径。仅从已保留、摘要相同的产物恢复 1,871,287 "
"bytes；原始报告和资格没有重写，首次闭包失败仍保留。八个完整闭包随后通过原始检查器。归档 Native 可执行文件和测试源码也可审计；Native "
"binary 摘要明确在归档时绑定，不冒充执行时签名。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:57
msgid "Exact candidate image costs"
msgstr "精确候选镜像成本"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:59
msgid ""
"These are the recorded GNU Arm 14.3.rel1 reference images, measured from the"
" linked ELF and configuration. RAM below includes the 2048-byte MSP "
"reservation; all eight images reserve zero libc heap. These values describe "
"the selected reference firmware, not a product workload, runtime stack high-"
"water, interrupt latency or WCET. The result index retains loaded Flash "
"bytes, address footprint, per-domain RAM and the original budget reports "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"以下为 GNU Arm 14.3.rel1 参考镜像记录，测量来自实际链接 ELF 和配置。RAM 包含 2048-byte MSP 预留，八个镜像的 "
"libc heap 均为零。这些值描述所选参考固件，不是产品负载、运行栈峰值、中断延迟或 WCET。结果索引分别保留 Flash "
"LOAD、地址跨度、各域 RAM 和原始预算报告。"

