#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:90
msgid ""
"The public device architecture remains static typed factory plus immutable "
"polymorphic interfaces. Factory lookup does not allocate, start hardware or "
"take a lock. New modes extend selected private providers and configuration "
"facts; they do not add a runtime registry, implicit worker or mandatory OS "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"公共设备架构仍为静态类型化工厂与不可变多态接口。Factory 获取不分配、不启动硬件、不加锁。新模式扩展选中的私有 provider "
"和配置事实，不增加运行时 registry、隐式 worker 或必需 OS 层。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:95
msgid ""
"H743 DMA borrows request and payload storage until acquire-observed SETTLED."
" Cache-enabled transfers require the caller to own complete aligned cache "
"lines; the provider does not round maintenance outward into neighboring "
"allocations or allocate a bounce buffer. Cancellation and timeout do not "
"revoke the borrow. Failure to withdraw hardware references retains storage "
"in quarantine."
msgstr ""
"H743 DMA 借用 request 和 payload 到 acquire-observed SETTLED。启用 Cache "
"时，调用者须独占完整对齐 cache line；provider 不向外取整触及相邻分配，也不分配 bounce "
"buffer。取消和超时不撤销借用，无法撤回硬件引用时保留隔离中的存储。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:101
msgid ""
"The U575 reference admits a fixed TZEN=1 boot profile and an immutable "
"unprivileged NonSecure thread without NonSecure interrupts, an RTOS or "
"concurrent DMA. It clears and verifies future NonSecure RAM before changing "
"attribution, checks final protection state, and enters through the actual "
"compiler CMSE sequence. Its synchronous gateway copies bounded input and "
"checks output before publication. This does not implement general "
"asynchronous cross-domain loans, arbitrary userspace tasks, product "
"authentication or secure update policy. See the [complete "
"contract](../design/u575-trustzone-contract.md)."
msgstr ""
"U575 参考只接纳固定 TZEN=1 boot profile 和不可变的非特权 NonSecure Thread，没有 NS 中断、RTOS 或并发"
" DMA。改变归属前先清零并验证未来 NS RAM，再检查最终保护状态，经实际编译器 CMSE 序列进入。同步 gateway "
"复制有界输入并在发布前检查输出。它不实现通用异步跨域借用、任意 userspace "
"任务、产品认证或安全升级。见[完整合同](../design/u575-trustzone-contract.md)。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:110
msgid "Evidence rules"
msgstr "证据规则"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:112
msgid ""
"Normal commit hooks execute the complete GoogleTest/GoogleMock, "
"configuration and tool suites for behavioral changes. Formal qualification "
"additionally binds a clean canonical commit and tree, actual compiler "
"inputs, raw command output, configuration and linked artifacts. Failed "
"attempts remain failed evidence; changing the source requires new source-"
"bound execution."
msgstr ""
"行为变更的普通 commit hooks 执行完整 GoogleTest／GoogleMock、配置和工具测试。正式资格另外绑定干净 canonical"
" commit/tree、实际 compiler 输入、原始命令输出、配置和链接产物。失败尝试保留为失败；源码改变后需要新的源码绑定执行。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:118
msgid ""
"The verification work exposed missing generated-header input in the H743 ARM"
" startup test, a fixed virtual-environment path in CPU configuration tests, "
"an uncontrolled scheduling assumption in a serial-noise test, and lost "
"forced-include context in static analysis. Sanitizer jobs also exposed "
"register-mask width conversions in host models and signal-dependent "
"termination observers. Their regressions retain the actual compiler warnings"
" and production nonreturning loops; test observers must work without a "
"signal-delivery point inside those loops. U575 production clock and MPU "
"masks also required explicit 32-bit operands before bit operations for GCC "
"13 on the LP64 sanitizer host. The independent comparison found identical "
"allocated ARM sections for the tested old/new translation units after "
"normalizing `__FILE__`; this is a scoped code and storage comparison, not "
"measured cycles or a promise for every compiler. Regression evidence and "
"final execution status belong with the delivery index. No suppression or "
"skipped test can substitute for closing these findings."
msgstr ""
"验证发现 H743 ARM 启动测试缺少生成头输入、CPU 配置测试固定虚拟环境路径、串口噪声测试不受控调度假设，以及静态分析丢失 forced-"
"include 上下文。Sanitizer 还发现主机模型寄存器 mask "
"宽度转换和依赖信号的终止观察者。回归保留真实编译器警告和生产非返回循环；观察者必须不依赖循环中的信号投递点。GCC 13／LP64 sanitizer "
"主机还要求 U575 生产时钟和 MPU mask 在位操作前明确 32-bit operand。独立比较在归一化 `__FILE__` "
"后发现被测旧／新 translation unit 的 ARM 已分配 section 相同；这是限定范围的代码和存储比较，不是实测 cycles "
"或所有编译器保证。回归及最终状态归入交付索引，关闭这些问题不能用 suppression 或跳过测试替代。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:133
msgid ""
"Offline candidates cover the eight maintained public H743/U575 combinations "
"of empty/IRQ-UART assemblies and baremetal/FreeRTOS. Each requires two "
"fresh, network-disabled builds and comparison of actual ELF/BIN bytes, with "
"both maps and raw logs retained. The H743 cache/DMA test fixtures and U575 "
"paired-image reference have their own ARM evidence; they are outside those "
"eight single-image candidate configurations. An unsigned software candidate "
"is not a product release or physical qualification."
msgstr ""
"离线候选覆盖 H743／U575 维护中的八个公开组合：empty／IRQ-UART 与裸机／FreeRTOS。各自要求两次全新断网构建和实际 "
"ELF／BIN 字节比较，并保留两份 map 及日志。H743 cache／DMA 夹具和 U575 配对参考具有各自 ARM "
"证据，不属于八个单镜像候选。无签名软件候选不是产品发布或物理资格。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:141
msgid "Durable evidence"
msgstr "持久证据"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:143
msgid ""
"The local archive is `/workspace/nexus-soc-delivery-98270512/platform-"
"evidence.tar.gz`: 1,269,027,807 bytes, SHA-256 "
"`3aae3a6b96701ce1a042cb4e43078d00d59ba5460ebc4816fa68e2fe4a8fe41c`. Its "
"embedded `delivery-manifest.json` and external manifest describe 216,230 "
"entries, including 173,376 regular files. Original raw paths and record "
"bytes remain unchanged. Resolve the recorded final execution root beneath "
"`platform/`; additional roots and nested Native/source archives have "
"explicit member maps. The result index binds the archive, manifests and "
"verification receipts. An independent streaming review checked every outer "
"member, all eight candidate payload closures, the three nested Native/source"
" archives and the exact source identities from the retained archive bytes; "
"no full unpack or original-root fallback was used."
msgstr ""
"本地归档为 `/workspace/nexus-soc-delivery-98270512/platform-"
"evidence.tar.gz`：1,269,027,807 bytes，SHA-256 "
"`3aae3a6b96701ce1a042cb4e43078d00d59ba5460ebc4816fa68e2fe4a8fe41c`。内嵌 "
"`delivery-manifest.json` 和外部清单描述 216,230 项，含 173,376 个普通文件。原始 raw path "
"和记录字节不变。在 `platform/` 下解析最终执行根；其他根和嵌套 Native／source "
"归档有显式成员映射。结果索引绑定归档、清单和校验回执。独立流式审查从保留归档字节检查每个外层成员、八个候选 payload 闭包、三个嵌套 "
"Native／source 归档及精确源码身份，没有完整解包或原始根回退。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:157
msgid ""
"All eight candidates also passed actual verification after copying to "
"separate fresh directories while access to original evidence, SDK, OCI and "
"ARM tool roots was denied. Original-path read attempts were zero. This "
"verifies their packed evidence closure; rebuilding still requires provision "
"of the recorded external OCI image and GNU Arm toolchain, whose binaries are"
" not embedded. The local archive is not a published GitHub Release asset or "
"a signed product release."
msgstr ""
"将八个候选复制到独立全新目录并禁止访问原始 evidence、SDK、OCI、ARM "
"工具根后，均实际通过校验，原始路径读取尝试为零。这验证打包证据闭包；重建仍需提供记录的外部 OCI 和 GNU Arm "
"工具链，二进制未嵌入。此本地归档不是已发布 GitHub Release asset 或已签名产品发布。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:164
msgid "Remaining acceptance"
msgstr "剩余验收"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:166
msgid ""
"SOC-28 through SOC-32 and SOC-36 are exact partial references. Their "
"original hardware, peripheral and isolation exits remain open. SOC-33 "
"bootloader/running state handoff, SOC-34 dynamic frequency changes and "
"SOC-35 deep STOP with continuous time are not implemented. SOC-37 through "
"SOC-55 provide station, admission, capture and result-validation tooling; "
"physical execution remains pending equipment."
msgstr ""
"SOC-28 至 SOC-32 和 SOC-36 是精确的部分参考，原始硬件、外设、隔离退出条件保持开放。SOC-33 "
"bootloader／运行态交接、SOC-34 动态变频、SOC-35 连续计时 deep STOP 未实现。SOC-37 至 SOC-55 提供 "
"station、准入、采集和结果校验工具；物理执行等待设备。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md:173
msgid ""
"Fixed clock profiles do not establish DVFS. Ordinary WFI or tickless idle "
"does not establish deep STOP. Host models and linked ARM images do not "
"establish electrical behavior, DMA/cache coherence on silicon, TrustZone "
"isolation, interrupt latency, measured power or WCET. Applications, PCB-"
"specific policies and recovery decisions remain in external projects."
msgstr ""
"固定时钟不建立 DVFS，普通 WFI／tickless idle 不建立 deep STOP。主机模型和链接 ARM 镜像不建立电气、硅片 "
"DMA／cache 一致性、TrustZone 隔离、中断延迟、实测功耗或 WCET。应用、PCB 专有政策与恢复由外部工程负责。"
